[[:db/retract 17592186124879 :question/answer-fields 17592186121874] {:db/id 17592186124587 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6343760b-b53e-5293-9f9e-2e583031956b"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-6343760b-b53e-5293-9f9e-2e583031956b" :question/id #uuid "6343760b-b53e-5293-9f9e-2e583031956b" :question/math-academy-id "q-164424" :question/problem "What is the domain in the $xy$-plane of the elliptic cylinder $\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{36}=1?$" :question/worked-solution "The full expression describing all points on our elliptic cylinder is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{36}=1,\\,z=k\n$$\n\nwhere $k\\in R$ can vary arbitrarily. \n\nThe domain of any cylinder in the $xy$-plane is its base curve. Hence, in this case, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}:\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{36}=1}\n$$\n\nwhich can be written as\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}:\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{{2}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{6}^{2}}=1}.\n$$\n\nThis is an ellipse centered at $(4,2)$ with semi-axes of lengths $2$ and $6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b9e78ba6-8720-5926-8f0b-e52d4b64b7d0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b9e78ba6-8720-5926-8f0b-e52d4b64b7d0" :answer-field/id #uuid "b9e78ba6-8720-5926-8f0b-e52d4b64b7d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-242e6d5f-d8c9-5706-a049-e8d876e8cf4d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3a86a3b3-9ac2-5bfe-8094-01d6a3bffb3a" "answer-989114cb-f25b-5fc1-b192-1030cf33ffd9" "answer-242e6d5f-d8c9-5706-a049-e8d876e8cf4d" "answer-70d01c11-f202-5519-a0ea-00fb5b34ce79" "answer-2db77962-9dd8-5e3e-afd9-c903fc200b96"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3a86a3b3-9ac2-5bfe-8094-01d6a3bffb3a" :answer/id #uuid "3a86a3b3-9ac2-5bfe-8094-01d6a3bffb3a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An ellipse centered at $(-4,-2)$ with semi-axes of lengths $2$ and $6.$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-989114cb-f25b-5fc1-b192-1030cf33ffd9" :answer/id #uuid "989114cb-f25b-5fc1-b192-1030cf33ffd9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An ellipse centered at $(2,\\sqrt{2})$ with semi-axes of lengths $4$ and $36.$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-242e6d5f-d8c9-5706-a049-e8d876e8cf4d" :answer/id #uuid "242e6d5f-d8c9-5706-a049-e8d876e8cf4d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An ellipse centered at $(4,2)$ with semi-axes of lengths $2$ and $6.$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70d01c11-f202-5519-a0ea-00fb5b34ce79" :answer/id #uuid "70d01c11-f202-5519-a0ea-00fb5b34ce79" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The interior and boundary of an ellipse centered at $(2,\\sqrt{2})$ with semi-axes of lengths $4$ and $36.$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2db77962-9dd8-5e3e-afd9-c903fc200b96" :answer/id #uuid "2db77962-9dd8-5e3e-afd9-c903fc200b96" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The interior and boundary of an ellipse centered at $(4,2)$ with semi-axes of lengths $2$ and $6.$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-8c885820-a4e6-551c-b58e-779ad796568b" :activity/id #uuid "8c885820-a4e6-551c-b58e-779ad796568b" :activity/title "Cylinders" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050123 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-84b4522c-b64f-561e-af00-35a410d9aa0f" "step-62e270dc-12aa-54da-a6ae-4add22cc9797" "step-5707a2b8-ff1e-50c1-9adc-a0aa60ce9a37" "step-33921a36-2e91-50fa-a06c-a30b1124550d" "step-1c159990-55c8-5aa1-b89e-ba1b9d7acf3b"] :activity/first-step "step-84b4522c-b64f-561e-af00-35a410d9aa0f" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-84b4522c-b64f-561e-af00-35a410d9aa0f" :step/id #uuid "84b4522c-b64f-561e-af00-35a410d9aa0f" :step/content 17592186124879 :step/next "step-62e270dc-12aa-54da-a6ae-4add22cc9797" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-62e270dc-12aa-54da-a6ae-4add22cc9797"